      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I knew you'd want to hear it!\r\nActually...",
        "Jp" : "やっぱり聞きたいよね！\r\n実は――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 665685,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "There was apparently an exquisite hot pot dish\r\nmade by a former bandit turned cook.\r\nSer Sunika also seems to have eaten it\r\njust once before.",
        "Jp" : "前に盗賊だった料理人さんが作ってくれた\r\n絶品の鍋料理があったらしくてさ\r\nスニーカーさんも一度だけ\r\n食べたことがあるみたいなの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675603,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But the person who made it\r\nhas already left the bandits,\r\nso we can't contact them.",
        "Jp" : "でも、それを作った人はもう\r\n盗賊から足を洗っちゃって\r\n連絡が取れないんだって"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675604,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We don't even have a recipe,\r\nso making it again sounds tough...",
        "Jp" : "ちゃんとしたレシピもないし\r\nもう作るのは難しそうなんだけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675605,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "At the very least, they\r\nwant to know what kind of\r\nmeat was in that pot—\r\nthe one described as\r\n\"Soft and fluffy, but with a toothsome bite.\"",
        "Jp" : "せめてその鍋に入っていた\r\n\"フワフワなのに、ワイルドな噛みごたえ\"なお肉の正体を知りたいんだって"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675606,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So—after investigating and\r\nsetting up a cage, it was all\r\nfine, but now they're scared\r\nghosts might show up, so\r\nthey want us to check it out.",
        "Jp" : "で――\r\n色々調べて檻を仕掛けたのはいいけど\r\nお化けが出そうな気がして怖いから\r\nアタシたちに様子を見てきて欲しいんだって"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675607,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You can't help but get\r\ncurious after hearing that,\r\nright? Get ready and let's\r\nset out immediately!",
        "Jp" : "こんな話聞いたら、気になっちゃうよね？\r\n準備できたら、すぐにでも出発しようよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675608,
      "MsgType" : 0,
